    {
      "row": "notes",
      "title": "Three vision strategies, side by side",
      "text": "Gemma-4 pools to a fixed 280 tokens per image (constant cost, lossy). Qwen3-VL merges 2×2 and re-injects three mid-ViT levels (scaling cost, most detail). Qwen3.8 merges 2×2 but drops the re-injection — the middle option.",
